    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Fairy Li Shan describes captivating sea inside Jade Pool blessed land to Fang Yuan and Hei Lou Lan: under illusory peach trees lie seas of grass and flowers, including large patches of groundmat grass like green carpets. The grass itself is ordinary.",
        "chapters": [
