      },
      {
        "text": "Captivating sea is a restricted region of Jade Pool blessed land. The groundmat grass sits under a forest of illusory peach trees together with colorful flowers and poisonous purple heart flowers. Fang Yuan treats these hazards as minor inconveniences. Fairy Li Shan calls them small problems for Gu Immortals; peach wolves dwell in the illusory peach tree forest, and Miniscule Mountain lies in the depths of captivating sea.",
